                                <color key="backgroundColor" white="1" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="genericGamma22GrayColorSpace"/>
                                <string key="text">Welcome to our DOE consultant search tool.From here, you will be able be to specify the type of consultant you need to hire and then review a list of candidates in our database who have consulted for others at the DOE. You will be able to view their resume, the job description and job titles of their consultanting positions at the DOE(if available),and the performance rating provided on their work (if available).

You will then be able to select up to three prospective candidates to interview either in person or over the phone. The system will handle all the scheduling.
After the interview process is complete, you can select a consultant to retain or go back and search for more candidates.</string>
                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" type="system" pointSize="14"/>
                                <textInputTraits key="textInputTraits" autocapitalizationType="sentences"/>
