                                            <string key="text">Based on our calculations of the YTD payroll connected to the consultant you are requesting, the requested compensation will result in the identified consultant earning more than $500.00/day and/or more than $30,000/calendar year. As such, a waiver must be submitted and approved prior to work commencing. Your order will be saved in our system until the waiver is obtained. You will be notified via email regarding the status of such waiver request and provided instructions for completing this work order. To determine the type of waiver needed, please answer the waiver questions below.</string>
